  dialog:
  - icon: {fileID: 3087020746046724720, guid: e9b81b5975bacc34fb44a4e8f2433f3b, type: 3}
    text: Hey, you. You are matching someone who mayor was talikng about. Are you
      a new owner of pumpkin farm?
    Name: Piggy
    Player: 0
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1b3a469b32e8d34eb31afe9f0bfd4fd, type: 3}
    text: em... Hello, you are right.
    Name: Player
    Player: 1
  - icon: {fileID: 3087020746046724720, guid: e9b81b5975bacc34fb44a4e8f2433f3b, type: 3}
    text: i always happy to see new members of the village. I m piggy, workshop worker.
    Name: Piggy
    Player: 0
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1b3a469b32e8d34eb31afe9f0bfd4fd, type: 3}
    text: That's great, do you have something valuable for my farm.
    Name: Player
    Player: 1
  - icon: {fileID: 3087020746046724720, guid: e9b81b5975bacc34fb44a4e8f2433f3b, type: 3}
    text: Sorry, i dont think so, you better check CRAFT store or SUPERMARKET
    Name: Piggy
    Player: 0
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1b3a469b32e8d34eb31afe9f0bfd4fd, type: 3}
    text: Thanks. See you later bye
    Name: Player
    Player: 1
